{"parse": {"title": "PD-05", "pageid": 144774, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/PD-04\" title=\"PD-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">PD-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/PD-06\" title=\"PD-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">PD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.96.B0.E5.BC.8F.E8.8B.B1.E9.9B.84\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"新式英雄\">新式英雄</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 新式英雄</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Different Definition of \"Hero\"</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>他<span class=\"color-value\"></span>忠<span class=\"color-value\"></span>诚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>正<span class=\"color-value\"></span>直<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>却<span class=\"color-value\"></span>敏<span class=\"color-value\"></span>感<span class=\"color-value\"></span>暴<span class=\"color-value\"></span>躁<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>说<span class=\"color-value\"></span>话<span class=\"color-value\"></span>带<span class=\"color-value\"></span>脏<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>到<span class=\"color-value\"></span>底<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>受<span class=\"color-value\"></span>过<span class=\"color-value\"></span>什<span class=\"color-value\"></span>么<span class=\"color-value\"></span>创<span class=\"color-value\"></span>伤<span class=\"color-value\"></span>？<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 38510106</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_20\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_20\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-s02_bg_20.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-s02_bg_20.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_20.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-s02_bg_20.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_20.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的访客们跟着左伶来到了展览馆的主展厅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>大厅一片狼藉，机器人的残骸与建筑废墟交杂着堆在一起，尚存理智的科学家们在墙角处瑟缩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>右伶正在调试着摆在地上的几枚白色圆形物体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>地上摆着的是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>这是脉冲地雷防护线，可使机器人短暂失去行动能力，对人体无害。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>左伶动作轻柔地将科学家的尸体摆在展厅的右侧，那里已经躺了几具蒙上白布的尸体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>随后，左伶与右伶相视一眼，双双向对方点了一下头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">右伶：</div><div>你们本不该出现在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们发现了一名幸存者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>顺着年轻访客的手势，右伶看向那名被缠成蛹却仍旧保持扭动的科学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">右伶：</div><div>了解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>右伶轻步走过去，将他与幸存者们安置在一起。而左伶走向管理终端，在上面操作着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-314910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-314910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-314910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>尝试接管展览馆管理权限……失败，第十六次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>请各位不要惊慌，我们已经派出了增援。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">右伶：</div><div>这些用于应对特殊作战的人员会将你们带离这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">右伶：</div><div>请站到防护线后面来，失控的机器人很可能再次发起进攻，在增援到达之前，我有责任保证你们的安全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>又是失控的机器人吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>双生舞伶再次合为一体，升上半空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-314901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-314901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-314901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶&amp;右伶：</div><div>未扫描到敌对单位信号……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>声音越来越近了，做好战斗准备。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_cg_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_cg_11\"><img alt=\"s02_cg_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/Cg-s02_cg_11.png/600px-Cg-s02_cg_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/Cg-s02_cg_11.png/900px-Cg-s02_cg_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/Cg-s02_cg_11.png/1200px-Cg-s02_cg_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>真该直接把门锁都炸了，焦巴脆[Crispy critters]！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_20\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_20\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-s02_bg_20.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-s02_bg_20.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_20.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-s02_bg_20.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_20.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_cg_11.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_cg_11\"><img alt=\"s02_cg_11\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/Cg-s02_cg_11.png/600px-Cg-s02_cg_11.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/Cg-s02_cg_11.png/900px-Cg-s02_cg_11.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/33/Cg-s02_cg_11.png/1200px-Cg-s02_cg_11.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>爆炸产生的烟尘在四周飞扬，年轻的访客们急忙挥手清出一片视野。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>咳，咳咳……我听见了……难道是什么魔精[critter]造成的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>来者似乎在烟尘中踢着什么金属做的物品，爆炸声消散后，丁零当啷的声音响彻整个展览馆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>这种门锁到底有什么用，查尔斯？只防傻子？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一名身材魁梧的男子扛着枪从灰色的烟雾团中走了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650816.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-650816.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650816.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650816.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-650816.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650816.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/HeadIconSmall-650816.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650816.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>他看上去并不像机器人，而且神志似乎也正常。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-305712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>是吗？可是他看上去在跟自己的手套吵架……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>别这么大火气，少校，有我在，这种锁不会对你产生什么阻碍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>没你它们也拦不住我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>嗯……我不会否认。但我可以直接联系双生舞伶，让她们把门都打开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>你……我都开完锁了你才告诉我？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>毕竟看你乐在其中嘛。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_20\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_20\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-s02_bg_20.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-s02_bg_20.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_20.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-s02_bg_20.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_20.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>双生舞伶解除了警戒状态，从空中缓缓降落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-650710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-650710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/HeadIconSmall-650710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>怎么回事？这里怎么还有小孩？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男子扫过眼前的三人，一边拍打着沾到自己身上的灰尘，一边走到双生舞伶的面前，拍了拍自己的胸膛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>代号P-3。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>以及他的好朋友——手套查尔斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>听说聚合物展览馆出了一点小问题，为了防止此事发展成国际外交丑闻，妨碍“大集体2.0”的开启。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>谢切诺夫博士派我们来这里协助你们查出幕后黑手，平息事态。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>收到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">右伶：</div><div>依据目前获取的信息，谢切诺夫博士似乎已经确认了这是一起针对“大集体2.0”的袭击。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>哈，当然！能把展览馆权限黑走的人背后不会太简单。有很多人都看谢切诺夫博士不爽，觉得他碍了自己的路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>比如莫洛托夫，比如那几个国家……你们知道的，那几个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>莫洛托夫……我想起来了，在大讲堂中跟谢切诺夫博士合影的那个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>什么？他居然也来了？那他现在去哪里了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>谢切诺夫博士的演讲结束后，莫洛托夫同志就乘车离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>哼，跑得真快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>谢谢你们的情报，女士们。现在你们可以去歇息了，这里我接手了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶：</div><div>未接到任务结束指令，我们仍需要保护这些科学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>这任务我也包了，查尔斯，给我来点目标数据，就从这三个孩子开始吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>P-3向年轻的访客们张开手，手套的卷须似是在空气中捕食某种微生物一般舞动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>哦，这可有点麻烦……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X遮住胸前的名牌，试图让仿冒的身份逃脱机械的扫视。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这位先生，我们是其他国家的科学家，是受邀来参加聚合物国际峰会的，你们的数据库里可能没有我们的相关信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我想我们相互介绍一下就好。我叫维尔汀，这位是小梅斯梅尔，这位是X。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手套的卷须缓缓地减小了舞动的幅度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>她说得对，没有数据。不仅没有数据，我发现，两位小姐还没有聚合过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>没有聚合过？！天呐……太少见了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>先生们，我们应该把时间放在搜救幸存者上……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>而且，出入境记录中也没有相匹配的数据……少校，甚至他们的信息今天才被加到国际峰会的邀请名单上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>非法入境？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>我想是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>P-3将手中的枪上了膛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>P-3少校……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>嗯——在会引起国际外交丑闻的袭击事件中遇见了非法入境的外国人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>少年间谍？我只是听说过，没想到今天见到了真人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>不是这样的，P-3少校，请听我解释……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>应该把他们送到哪里比较合适，查尔斯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>情况复杂，也许是未成年人事务委员会，也许是某种可以处理间谍的机构……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"652902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"652902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/HeadIconSmall-652902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-652902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……能说点什么吗，X？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>也许……是这里信号不太好，你的手套需要再查查看？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">查尔斯：</div><div>不太好笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>先逃跑吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>附议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>三人转头便跑，看着三个逃跑的身影，P-3本能地追了上去，却又突然想起了什么。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s02_bg_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s02_bg_20\"><img alt=\"s02_bg_20\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-s02_bg_20.png/600px-Cg-s02_bg_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-s02_bg_20.png/900px-Cg-s02_bg_20.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-s02_bg_20.png/1200px-Cg-s02_bg_20.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>啧，间谍还是抓活的要紧……那个，双生舞伶！帮我抓住他们！要活的，我们三个一人一个！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶&amp;右伶：</div><div>收到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>双生舞伶向年轻的访客们飞去，更快的左伶即将抓住小梅斯梅尔的手臂——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650815.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650815.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-650815.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650815.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>嘿，尝尝这个！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>X突然回头，作势抬手，似乎想向身后的追兵们扔出某物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">左伶&amp;右伶：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>瞬间，X张开手掌，露出手心的一张传送软盘，对着正在追击的舞伶们粲然一笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>骗你们的，其实什么也没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话音刚落，三人周围出现一道刺目辉光。转瞬之间，三人的身影便随着辉光一起消失不见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">P-3：</div><div>……魔术？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "PD-05"}}